{"opening work archive / 正在開啟作品集":"t0000","work":"t0328","spring yearn / visual practice":"t0002","opening archive":"t0003","index":"t0004","curating the frame":"t0005","i loved your work. some of it found its way into mine. it hurts to know there won’t be another edit. thank you, 4never.":"t0006","我很喜歡你的作品。 我的一些剪輯裡，也有從你那裡得到的靈感。 想到以後看不到你的新作品，還是很難過。 謝謝你，4never。":"t0006","i loved your work.":"t0007","我很喜歡你的作品。":"t0007","some of it found its way into mine.":"t0008","我的一些剪輯裡，也有從你那裡得到的靈感。":"t0008","it hurts to know there won’t be another edit.":"t0009","想到以後看不到你的新作品，還是很難過。":"t0009","thank you, 4never.":"t0010","謝謝你，4never。":"t0010","watching your edits often gave me ideas of my own. i wish you could know how much that meant. i’m leaving these words for never— thank you. i’ll keep editing, and i’ll remember you.":"t0011","看你的作品時，常常會冒出自己的想法。 真希望你能知道，你帶給過我多少靈感。 留幾句話 for never—— 謝謝你。我會繼續剪片，也會記得你。":"t0011","watching your edits often gave me ideas of my own.":"t0012","看你的作品時，常常會冒出自己的想法。":"t0012","i wish you could know how much that meant.":"t0013","真希望你能知道，你帶給過我多少靈感。":"t0013","i’m leaving these words for never—":"t0014","留幾句話 for never——":"t0014","thank you. i’ll keep editing, and i’ll remember you.":"t0015","謝謝你。我會繼續剪片，也會記得你。":"t0015","some work makes you want to go make something yourself. yours did. thank you for sharing it. i’ll remember you, 4never.":"t0016","有些作品，會讓人看完也想動手試試。 你的就是。 謝謝你做過那些剪輯。 我會記得你，4never。":"t0016","some work makes you want to go make something yourself.":"t0017","有些作品，會讓人看完也想動手試試。":"t0017","yours did.":"t0018","你的就是。":"t0018","thank you for sharing it.":"t0019","謝謝你做過那些剪輯。":"t0019","i’ll remember you, 4never.":"t0020","我會記得你，4never。":"t0020","pause a moment":"t0021","停留片刻":"t0021","close this note":"t0022","關閉紀念文字":"t0022","in memory of 4never":"t0023","紀念 4never":"t0023","— springyearn":"t0024","switch to chinese":"t0025","切換為英文":"t0025","home":"t0026","首頁":"t0026","work archive":"t0395","作品集":"t0328","project files":"t0028","專案檔":"t0028","profile":"t0