 zip，下載後解壓縮不需再輸入密碼。":"t0066","contact springyearn":"t0067","聯絡 springyearn":"t0067","close":"t0068","關閉":"t0068","access password":"t0069","存取密碼":"t0069","verify & download":"t0070","驗證並下載":"t0070","confirm":"t0071","確認下載":"t0071","verifying…":"t0072","驗證中⋯⋯":"t0072","unable to authorize this download. please check your access or contact springyearn.":"t0073","無法授權此下載，請確認存取權限或聯絡 springyearn。":"t0073","no downloadable build":"t0074","未提供下載版本":"t0074","the download could not be completed. please try again or contact springyearn.":"t0075","下載未能完成，請重試或聯絡 springyearn。":"t0075","download started. you can extract the zip without entering a password.":"t0076","已開始下載，zip 可直接解壓縮，不需再輸入密碼。":"t0076","share this project":"t0077","分享此專案":"t0077","project link copied.":"t0078","已複製專案連結。":"t0078","copy this project link":"t0079","複製此專案連結":"t0079","small tools, ideas to test.":"t0080","工具、原型， 還有一些實驗。":"t0080","small tools,":"t0081","工具、原型，":"t0081","ideas to test.":"t0082","還有一些實驗。":"t0082","tools and experiments i’ve built in davinci resolve and fusion. some are usable builds; others are prototypes or research. each starts with an idea worth trying.":"t0083","這裡記錄我在 davinci resolve 和 fusion 裡做的工具、插件與實驗。有些已經能用，有些還是原型或研究；有個想試的點子，就動手做做看。":"t0083","{0} development records / 2026":"t0084","{0} 筆開發紀錄 / 2026":"t0084","return home":"t0085","返回首頁":"t0085","build language":"t0086","版本語言":"t0086","most files currently available here are traditional chinese versions.":"t0087","目前大多數檔案都是繁體中文版本。":"t0087","sort by":"t0088","排列依據":"t0088","order":"t0089","排列方向":"t0089","ascending":"t0090","升序":"t0090","descending":"t0091","降序":"t0091","original order":"t0092","原始順序":"t0092","last updated":"t0093","最後更新日":"t0093","created date":"t0094","建立日期":"t0094","name":"t0095","名稱":"t0095","tool type":"t0096","工具類型":"t0096","current order:":"t0097","目前排列：":"t0097","lab / experiments":"t0183","explore the site":"t0099","created:":"t0100","建立：":"t0100","; last updated:":"t0101","；最後更新：":"t0101","history / checkpoints":"t0102","歷史 checkpoint":"t0102","full 0.3.5 validation record":"t0103","完整 0.3.5 驗證紀錄":"t0103","springyearn® — lab / experiments":"t0104","0.4.1 / host acceptance pending":"t0105","0.4.1／實機驗收待確認":"t0105","0.4.1-usability extends the 0.4.0 dynamics tools with one-click environment reset, batch clearing of joints / force fields / events, text-split node layout near the source, plain-language controls and tooltips, and exact constant / linear keyframe merging. the delivered release records 245 passing tests, 61 lua / fuse syntax checks and 2 javascript syntax checks. the 0.4.0 host tests 1–4 were reported as passing; the new 0.4.1 ui, layout and reduced-key bake still await resolve host acceptance.":"t0106","0.4.1-usability 延續 0.4.0 的指定運動、關節與力場／事件功能，新增環境一鍵重設、關節／力場／事件批次清除、拆字節點在來源附近排版、通俗參數名稱與懸停說明，以及固定／嚴格直線關鍵幀合併。交付紀錄為 245 項測試通過、61 份 lua／fuse 與 2 份 javascript 語法檢查通過。0.4.0 主機測試 1–4 已回報通過；0.4.1 新介面、排版與精簡 bake 仍待 resolve 實機驗收。":"t0106","0.3.5 / verified checkpoint":"t0107","0.3.5／已驗證 checkpoint":"t0107","latest verified checkpoint: 0.3.5-perbody. per-object start frames, text/follower animation handoff, alpha handling and native keyframe bake fixes are in place; 158 tests pass, with 46 lua/fuse files and 2 preview javascript files passing syntax checks. resolve 21 visual acceptance, split-speed and hands-on workflow validation still remain.":"t0108","目前可驗證的最新 checkpoint 為 0.3.5-perbody。已完成每物件獨立起始影格、文字／follower 動畫接手、alpha 處理與原生關鍵幀 bake 修正；158 項測試全數通過，46 份 lua／fuse 與 2 份預覽 javascript 亦通過語法檢查。resolve 21 實機畫面、拆分速度與整體操作流程仍待最終驗收。":"t0108","0.1.0 / mvp":"t0109","cpu physics, native bake, undo and backup baseline.":"t0110","建立 cpu 物理、原生 bake、undo 與備份底座。":"t0110","0.3.5-perbody":"t0111","per-object start frames and animation handoff; 158 automated tests passed.":"t0112","逐物件起始影格與動畫接手；158 項自動測試通過。":"t0112","0.4.0-dynamics":"t0113","added specified motion, joints, force fields and events; host tests 1–4 reported passing.":"t0114","加入指定運動、關節、力場與事件；主機測試 1–4 回報通過。":"t0114","0.4.1-usability":"t0115","reset / clear controls, source-adjacent layout and exact linear-key merging; new host checks pending.":"t0116","新增重設／清除、來源附近排版與精確直線鍵合併；新版實機確認待完成。":"t0116","working":"t0117","可用":"t0117","a photoshop-like connected-area fill tool for fusion. it reads upstream rgba and supports tolerance, 4/8-way connectivity, alpha handling and blend controls; early crash and loading issues were fixed during testing.":"t0118","為 fusion 製作的類 photoshop 連通區域填色工具，可讀取上游 rgba，支援容差、4／8 向連通、alpha 與 blend 控制；早期新增節點閃退與載入問題已在測試中修正。":"t0118","connected-area fill with tolerance and alpha controls.":"t0119","建立連通填色、容差與 alpha 控制。":"t0119","removed unsafe pixel reads during precalc to address early resolve crashes.":"t0120","移除 precalc 階段的不安全像素讀取，修正早期 resolve 閃退問題。":"t0120","functional prototype":"t0121","可用原型":"t0121","an ignite-inspired lens dirt replacement exploring light and dirt layers, external dirt maps, mirrored ghosting, radial blur, and screen / add compositing. the prototype was iterated against reference outputs and mix behavior.":"t0122","以 ignite lens dirt 為參考製作的替代實驗，包含 light／dirt layer、外部 dirt map、鏡像鬼影、radial blur 與 screen／add 合成，並依參考輸出反覆調整混合行為。":"t0122","initial native fusion macro with procedural dirt.":"t0123","初版 fusion 原生 macro，以程序化雜訊產生污漬。":"t0123","direct installation and black-output fixes.":"t0124","加入直接安裝版本，修正黑畫面輸出。":"t0124","0.93 fullblend":"t0125","refined full blend controls while preserving the lens dirt pipeline.":"t0126","完善完整混合控制，保留原 lens dirt 處理管線。":"t0126","in development":"t0127","持續開發":"t0127","a native ofx experiment for resolve 21 combining tracking data with procedural fui overlays. core phases and safety tests progressed, while final windows and resolve integration validation remains part of development.":"t0128","面向 resolve 21 的原生 ofx 實驗，將追蹤資料與程序化 fui overlay 結合。核心階段與安全測試已有進展，windows 與 resolve 的最終整合驗證仍持續進行。":"t0128","0.1.0 / preview":"t0129","windows x64 preview of tracking and procedural fui overlays.":"t0130","建立 windows x64 追蹤與程序化 fui overlay 預覽版。":"t0130","windows release / test-build iteration.":"t0131","完成 windows 發行與測試包迭代。":"t0131","0.2.7 / gpu experimental":"t0132","gpu test build delivered; final resolve integration remains in development.":"t0133","交付 gpu 實驗測試版；resolve 最終整合仍在開發。":"t0133","research / design":"t0134","研究／設計階段":"t0134","a proposed resolve ofx workflow for loading and manipulating gaussian splatting assets such as .ply, .splat and .ksplat, with transform, opacity, sh, quality and depth controls explored at the design stage.":"t0135","研究如何在 resolve ofx 中載入與操作 gaussian splatting 資產，例如 .ply、.splat、.ksplat，並規劃 transform、opacity、sh、quality 與 depth 等控制。":"t0135","planned asset formats, transforms, sh and depth controls; no build recorded.":"t0136","規劃資產格式、transform、sh 與 depth 控制，尚無程式版本。":"t0136","tested in edit":"t0137","edit 頁面實測":"t0137","a lightweight compatibility experiment using multithreaded cpu edge-aware denoising and detail reconstruction. the windows x64 ofx was successfully used on a 1080p edit page workflow; fusion remained outside that test.":"t0138","以多執行緒 cpu 邊緣感知降噪與細節重建製作的相容性實驗。windows x64 ofx 已在 1080p edit 頁面成功使用，fusion 當時未納入實測。":"t0138","cpu edge-aware denoising and detail reconstruction; 1080p edit usage reported.":"t0139","建立 cpu 邊緣感知降噪與細節重建，已有 1080p edit 使用回報。":"t0139","early prototype":"t0140","早期原型":"t0140","an early resolve-compatible glitch fuse skeleton with amount, jitter and seed controls. it began as a pass-through testbed for displacement, rgb split, scanline noise and horizontal jitter experiments.":"t0141","早期的 resolve 相容 glitch fuse 骨架，具備 amount、jitter、seed 控制，最初作為 displace、rgb split、scanline noise 與 horizontal jitter 的測試底座。":"t0141","pass-through glitch skeleton with amount, jitter and seed.":"t0142","建立 amount、jitter、seed 控制的 pass-through glitch 骨架。":"t0142","compatibility prototype":"t0143","相容性原型":"t0143","a minimal pass-through fuse created while testing the fusion loading path. together with a hello fuse check, it helped verify that the local fuse search path and registration flow were working before larger experiments.":"t0144","為測試 fusion 載入流程製作的最小化 pass-through fuse，並搭配 hello fuse 驗證本機 fuse 搜尋路徑與註冊流程，作為後續較大型實驗的基礎。":"t0144","loading checkpoint":"t0145","minimal pass-through and hello fuse loading-path checks.":"t0146","以最小 pass-through 與 hello fuse 檢查載入路徑。":"t0146","0.3.0 test 4 / font fitting prototype":"t0147","0.3.0 test 4／字型貼合原型":"t0147","a stroke-by-stroke handwriting tool for text+ using ordered stroke paths, maskpaint, independent polylinestroke write on animation and text+ effectmask. the 0.2.1 coordinate fix was reported working; 0.3.0 test 4 fits the stroke centerlines and brush coverage to the rendered text+ alpha while preserving the original font and appearance. the supplied test 4 archive is available for authorized testing. different fonts and resolve 21 image / pixel behavior still await host acceptance; extreme decorative fonts and complex text layouts remain limitations.":"t0148","為 text+ 製作真正一筆一畫的手寫動畫：筆順路徑經 maskpaint、獨立 polylinestroke write on，接入 text+ effectmask，保留原本字型與外觀。0.2.1 座標修正已回報正常；0.3.0 test 4 新增以渲染後的 text+ alpha 貼合筆畫中心線與估算筆刷覆蓋，完整 test 4 安裝包已提供授權測試。不同字型與 resolve 21 image／pixel 介面仍待實機驗收，極端藝術字與複雜文字排版也仍有限制。":"t0148","initial text+ animation prototype.":"t0149","建立初版 text+ 動畫原型。":"t0149","independent stroke write on and corrected polylinestroke coordinates.":"t0150","加入獨立逐筆 write on，並修正 polylinestroke 座標。":"t0150","0.3.0 test 4":"t0151","fitted stroke paths and brush coverage to rendered text+ alpha; host checks pending.":"t0152","以渲染後 text+ alpha 貼合筆畫與筆刷覆蓋；實機確認待完成。":"t0152","independent visual creator":"t0153","獨立視覺創作者":"t0153","visual artist / editor":"t0154","視覺藝術家 / 剪輯師":"t0154","i make images move, and sometimes stay still.":"t0155","讓影像動起來，也做點靜態創作。":"t0155","i work across editing, motion, drawing, graphic design and 3d. if an idea calls for a different medium, i’m happy to try it.":"t0156","我做剪輯、動態圖形、繪畫、平面設計和 3d。有些點子適合用不同的方式呈現，那就試試看。":"t0156","take a look at my work":"t0157","看看作品集":"t0166","independent creative / taiwan":"t0158","獨立創作者 / 台灣":"t0158","01 / work archive":"t0159","01 / 作品集":"t0159","a little bit of everything.":"t0160","各種作品， 放在這裡。":"t0160","a little bit":"t0161","各種作品，":"t0161","of everything.":"t0162","放在這裡。":"t0162","editing, motion, app / ui, 3d, drawing and graphic design. browse by category, or see what catches your eye.":"t0163","剪輯、動態圖形、app／ui、3d、繪畫和平面設計。可以按分類逛，也可以直接點開感興趣的作品。":"t0163","selected work / more on the way":"t0164","精選作品／陸續更新":"t0164","archive index":"t0165","作品索引":"t0004","browse the work":"t0166","yearly highlights":"t0167","年度精華":"t0167","a year of edits":"t0168","這一年剪了什麼":"t0168","watch showreel":"t0169","觀看 showreel":"t0169","02 / profile":"t0170","02 / 關於我":"t0170","hi, i’m springyearn.":"t0171","嗨，我是 springyearn。":"t0171","hi, i’m":"t0172","嗨，我是":"t0172","springyearn.":"t0173","springyearn。":"t0173","i’m a visual artist, designer and editor based in taiwan, currently studying visual communication & animation design. i work with video, drawing, graphic design, compositing and 3d.":"t0174","我是來自台灣的視覺藝術家、設計師與剪輯師，目前就讀視覺傳達動畫設計系。平常做動態影像、繪畫、平面設計、合成和 3d。":"t0174","editing is at the center of what i do. trying other media gives me more ways to test an idea and see what works.":"t0175","剪輯是我的創作重心。試試其他媒介，也讓我能用不同的方法測試點子，看看什麼最適合。":"t0175","name / philosophy":"t0176","名稱 / 創作理念":"t0176","why springyearn?":"t0177","springyearn 是什麼意思？":"t0177","spring is about fresh starts, hope, and the energy to try again.":"t0178","spring 是春天，也代表新的開始、希望，以及再試一次的動力。":"t0178","yearn is the urge to learn something new and make the next thing a little better.":"t0179","yearn 是對新知識和新作品的期待，也希望每次都能再進步一點。":"t0179","put them together: stay curious, keep learning, keep making.":"t0180","合在一起，就是保持好奇、繼續學、繼續做。":"t0180","what i do":"t0181","我會做的事":"t0181","along the way":"t0182","一路以來":"t0182","lab / 實驗":"t0183","take a look in lab":"t0184","看看 lab":"t0184","03 / contact":"t0185","03 / 聯絡":"t0185","your next project, or a good food debate.":"