strokes, plus faint notebook ruling.":"t0406","新增可保存、以完整手勢為單位的復原；橡皮擦只擦實際經過的區域，並加入極淡筆記本橫線。":"t0406","enlarged resolve and fusion toolkit icons to match the application frames, and replaced medibang with the supplied droplet cutout.":"t0407","resolve 與 fusion 圖示放大至一致應用程式框線，medibang 改用提供圖檔的水滴去背。":"t0407","added maya and official software symbols to the homepage toolkit, with a muted ink treatment.":"t0408","首頁軟體工具列加入 maya 與各軟體官方圖示，統一為低飽和墨色風格。":"t0408","adjusted the individual-page play triangle for visual centering.":"t0409","單件頁播放三角形向左微調，改善視覺居中。":"t0409","opened a shared doodle whiteboard with drawing, colors, thin strokes, an own-stroke eraser and touch-friendly zoom/pan; saved new-board requests are checked hourly in codex.":"t0410","新增共用塗鴉白板，支援畫筆、顏色、細筆寬、自己的筆跡橡皮擦及觸控放大／移動；新增白板申請由 codex 每小時檢查通知。":"t0410","removed the duplicate view details overlay from project files preview images.":"t0411","移除 project files 預覽圖上重複的「查看詳情」提示。":"t0411","added play/open and new-tab cues to linked images in individual pages, matching youtube, instagram and full-image destinations.":"t0412","單件頁可點擊圖片加入播放／開啟及新分頁提示，依 youtube、instagram 或原圖連結顯示。":"t0412","rearranged selected works as tilted, staggered paper cards with gentle floating, moving orbit lines and tracing frames; motion pauses offscreen and supports reduced motion.":"t0413","精選作品改為傾斜錯落的紙卡，加入輕微漂浮、軌道線與流動外框；畫面外暫停並支援減少動態。":"t0413","made artwork covers and titles open their individual detail pages, with clear view details actions across the archives.":"t0414","作品封面與標題改為進入單件詳情頁，列表加入明確的「查看詳情」入口。":"t0414","kept sharing in individual pages or project download dialogs and removed index sharing controls.":"t0415","分享功能集中在單件頁或單一專案下載窗口，移除列表分享按鈕。":"t0415","highlighted the three selected works with a framed selection area, numbered seals and subtle decoration.":"t0416","三件精選作品加入選集外框、編號標記與細緻裝飾。":"t0416","mobile spring / yearn words now play once when visible and replay on tap, with reduced-motion support.":"t0417","手機 spring／yearn 文字捲入畫面時播放一次，點按可重播，並支援減少動態效果。":"t0417","added three selected works using the existing project descriptions, and retained the language preference across navigation and reloads.":"t0418","作品集加入三件精選作品，沿用已知介紹；中英文偏好在跨頁與重新載入後保留。":"t0418","added individual work and project files pages with share buttons, unique urls, preview covers and summaries.":"t0419","作品與 project files 加入單件頁面、分享按鈕、獨立網址、預覽封面及簡介。":"t0419","clarified that project files zip packages include media and standalone aep files do not.":"t0420","標示 project files 的 zip 包含素材、獨立 aep 不含素材。":"t0420","fixed italic letter clipping during the yearn stretch animation by allowing glyph overhang inside the word and reserving extra trailing space, while retaining the article boundary.":"t0421","修正 yearn 伸展動畫的斜體筆畫裁切：移除文字框內層裁切、增加末字預留空間，並保留介紹區塊的邊界。":"t0421","enlarged and darkened the memorial frame while retaining its intentional reveal condition.":"t0422","放大並加深紀念彩蛋的小線框，保留原本的特定觸發條件。":"t0422","restored project files and profile in the lab desktop navigation, and profile in project files.":"t0423","補齊 lab 桌面導覽的 project files、profile，以及 project files 頁的 profile。":"t0423","added contained, staggered spring / yearn letter animations with reduced-motion support.":"t0424","spring／yearn 涵意區加入逐字懸停動畫，預留邊界並支援減少動態效果。":"t0424","brightened the shared palette with a nearly white background and softer, less saturated blue-green and leaf tones while retaining readable control text.":"t0425","背景調為接近白色，藍綠與葉片色提亮並降低飽和度，控制項文字保留清楚對比。":"t0425","concealed the memorial note behind a deliberate footer interaction on home, work and lab, preserving its bilingual verses.":"t0426","首頁、作品與 lab 的紀念文字改為特定頁尾互動後才出現，保留原本中英紀念詩。":"t0426","unified interface colors and the interactive toon logo with the supplied five-color palette: deep teal, mist blue, pale mint, cream and olive.":"t0427","全站介面與互動三渲二 logo 統一使用提供的五色配色：深藍綠、霧藍、淡薄荷、米白及橄欖綠。":"t0427","redesigned the homepage project files entrance with an opening folder, a moving timeline and subtle spring leaves, including mobile and reduced-motion support.":"t0428","首頁 project files 入口加入展開專案匣、移動時間軸與細緻的 spring 葉片，支援手機與減少動態效果。":"t0428","set ratchet and blisters embedded previews to a quieter 25% initial volume while preserving manual volume changes during page interactions.":"t0429","ratchet 與 blisters 內嵌預覽的初始音量調為 25%，頁面互動不會重設手動調整的音量。":"t0429","added a compact press-and-release animation to the mobile menu open and close buttons, with reduced-motion support.":"t0430","手機選單開啟與關閉按鈕加入縮放回彈、圖示輕轉的點按動畫，並支援減少動態效果。":"t0430","restored the project files desktop navigation link to the same styling as other links.":"t0431","project files 桌面導覽連結恢復與其他連結一致的樣式。":"t0431","replaced mobile header links and language switching with a shared collapsible side menu on home, work, lab and project files.":"t0432","首頁、作品、lab 與 project files 的手機頂部改為共用側邊選單，收納導覽與中英文切換。":"t0432","highlighted the homepage project files entrance and added desktop/mobile top navigation.":"t0433","強化首頁 project files 入口，加入桌面與手機頂部導覽。":"t0433","aligned the project files category controls and made ae/davinci buttons filter the files, with an active selection.":"t0434","修正專案檔分類按鈕對齊，ae／davinci 按鈕改為實際篩選並標示選取狀態。":"t0434","simplified the bilingual contact notice.":"t0435","簡化中英聯絡告示文字。":"t0435","added a public project files page with separate after effects and davinci resolve sections, seven original downloads, video previews and a contact notice.":"t0436","新增公開 project files 頁面，分成 after effects 與 davinci resolve，收錄七個原始專案下載、影片預覽與聯絡告示。":"t0436","added project files entrances on home, work and lab.":"t0437","首頁、作品頁與 lab 新增 project files 入口。":"t0437","added a bilingual lab notice that most available files are currently traditional chinese versions.":"t0438","lab 新增雙語版本語言告示，說明目前大多數檔案為繁體中文版本。":"t0438","lab downloads now deliver the original unencrypted zip after one website password check, while public build files remain encrypted.":"t0439","lab 下載改為在網站輸入一次密碼後，直接取得不需密碼解壓的原始 zip；公開存放的版本仍保留加密保護。":"t0439","rewrote the bilingual 4never tributes as personal words of appreciation and remembrance, with the name’s wordplay kept only in the work verse.":"t0440","4never 雙語紀念文字改為更直接的欣賞、感謝與追念，名字諧音只保留在作品頁的一段。":"t0440","grouped same-day site updates into one daily entry with a version range and expandable complete bilingual notes.":"t0441","同一天的網站更新整合為一筆日誌，顯示版本範圍並可展開完整雙語更新內容。":"t0441","revised the tribute poems to explicitly remember 4never and his influence on my editing, with the name’s wordplay woven into the verses.":"t0442","紀念短詩明確保留對 4never 的追念與剪輯啟發，將名字的諧音融入詩句。":"t0442","restored a quiet 4never footer marker on home, work and lab.":"t0443","首頁、作品頁與 lab 頁尾入口改回低調的 4never 標記。":"t0443","reimagined the 4never tribute as a quiet 04 / infinity frame that reveals “for never...” and a different short verse on home, work and lab.":"t0444","4never 彩蛋改為低調的 04／∞ 畫格，展開「for never...」；首頁、作品頁與 lab 各留一段短詩。":"t0444","removed the memorial post link; the tribute now lives entirely in words and a small line gesture.":"t0445","移除紀念貼文連結，以文字與細微線條留下餘光。":"t0445","removed the duplicate discipline selector from all while keeping the main work filters.":"t0446","移除 all 介紹區重複的分類入口，保留作品區主要分類選單。":"t0446","added a quiet, expandable tribute to 4never in the work archive footer.":"t0447","作品頁頁尾新增低調、可展開的 4never 紀念彩蛋。":"t0447","added work archive sorting, with dated publication records and matched source-file clues; unknown dates remain unconfirmed.":"t0448","作品區新增排序功能，比對發布紀錄與原檔日期線索；未確認日期保持待考。":"t0448","redesigned all as numbered editorial plates with varied image sizes, project captions and a discipline index.":"t0449","all 改為編號圖版，加入不同尺寸的作品配置、作品標題與媒介分類索引。":"t0449","added lab sorting by last update, creation date, name, tool type or original order, with ascending and descending controls.":"t0450","lab 新增最後更新日、建立日期、名稱、工具類型與原始順序排列，以及升序／降序切換。":"t0450","added project creation / latest-update date ranges and compact, dated checkpoints for all nine lab projects.":"t0451","九個 lab 專案新增建立／最後更新日期區間與精簡、附日期的歷史 checkpoint。":"t0451","restored the custom cursor on checkpoint controls and added individual project sharing with direct links to authorized download dialogs.":"t0452","修復 checkpoint 控制的專屬游標，並新增可直達授權下載視窗的個別專案分享。":"t0452","updated fusiondynamics2d to 0.4.1-usability with its current aes-256 encrypted build, while preserving the 0.3.5 checkpoint.":"t0453","fusiondynamics2d 更新至 0.4.1-usability 與目前的 aes-256 加密版本，保留 0.3.5 checkpoint。":"t0453","added sy_handwriter as the ninth lab record with an authorized aes-256 download of the 0.3.0 test 4 font-fitting prototype and its remaining host tests.":"t0454","新增第九筆 lab 紀錄 sy_handwriter，提供 0.3.0 test 4 字型貼合原型的授權 aes-256 下載，並記錄待完成的實機測試。":"t0454","adjusted the historical visitor baseline to 3,280 while retaining live visitor statistics.":"t0455","將歷史訪客基準調整為 3,280，並保留即時訪客統計。":"t0455","added mouse / touch drag rotation, keyboard controls and reset for the 3d logo, with minimal toon shading and fine outlines.":"t0456","3d logo 加入滑鼠／觸控拖曳旋轉、鍵盤操作與重設，改用極簡三渲二色階及細描邊。":"t0456","animated the lab entrance leaves on hover and added a prominent confirmation button beside the download password field.":"t0457","lab 入口綠葉加入懸停動畫，下載密碼輸入框旁新增清楚可見的確認按鈕。":"t0457","moved the lab entrance below the work archive, with a restrained interactive card and fine-line spring motifs.":"t0458","將 lab 入口移至作品區下方，加入克制的互動卡片與細線 spring 元素。":"t0458","added a subtle interactive 3d logo from the supplied fbx in satin sage tones.":"t0459","以提供的 fbx 加入低調互動 3d logo，搭配霧面鼠尾草綠。":"t0459","restored visible cursors in download dialogs and repaired visitor statistics with a working service, retries and the preserved historical baseline.":"t0460","修復下載視窗中的游標可見性，並更換可用的訪客統計服務、加入重試與保留歷史基準值。":"t0460","opened authorized aes-256 zip downloads for five supplied resolve / fusion builds, including fusiondynamics2d 0.3.5-perbody.":"t0461","開放 5 份 resolve／fusion 版本的授權 aes-256 加密 zip 下載，包含 fusiondynamics2d 0.3.5-perbody。":"t0461","passwords are verified against the encrypted builds before download. projects without a supplied build retain their development records without download buttons.":"t0462","下載前以加密版本驗證密碼；未提供版本的專案保留開發紀錄，不顯示下載按鈕。":"t0462","moved all eight resolve / fusion development records to a dedicated lab / experiments page, with a compact homepage entry.":"t0463","將 8 筆 resolve／fusion 開發紀錄完整移至獨立 lab / experiments 頁面，首頁保留簡潔入口。":"t0463","added an authorized-download request flow. online password verification and encrypted builds remain pending secure service setup.":"t0464","新增授權下載申請流程；線上密碼驗證與加密版本下載待安全服務設定後開放。":"t0464","synced the fusiondynamics2d lab record to the latest verified 0.3.5-perbody checkpoint and its test / acceptance status.":"t0465","同步 fusiondynamics2d lab 紀錄至目前可驗證的 0.3.5-perbody checkpoint，並補充測試與驗收狀態。":"t0465","added lab / experiments with eight resolve and fusion development records while preserving existing site sections.":"t0466","新增 lab / experiments，收錄 8 筆 resolve／fusion 開發紀錄，並保留既有網站區塊與功能。":"t0466","changed past sy / changelog entries to stay collapsed by default and expand only when requested.":"t0467","將過往 sy / changelog 更新日誌改為預設隱藏，需手動展開才顯示歷史版本。":"t0467","added a browsable sy / changelog to preserve and review site update history.":"t0468","新增可瀏覽的 sy / changelog，用來保存並回顧網站更新歷史。":"t0468","adjusted overview media on devices without hover support so project thumbnails display in full color by default.":"t0469","調整不支援 hover 的裝置顯示邏輯，讓作品總覽縮圖在手機等觸控裝置上預設直接顯示彩色。":"t0469","added discord to the contact links at the bottom of the homepage.":"t0470","在首頁底部聯繫方式新增 discord 連結。":"t0470","added a historical baseline to the total visitor display while preserving live visitor growth.":"t0471","為總瀏覽人數加入歷史基準值，同時保留後續真實訪客數持續累加。":"t0471","added the riot games × rosewood creative valorant esports project to the homepage practice timeline.":"t0472","在首頁創作時間線新增 riot games × rosewood creative 的 valorant esports 官方專案。":"t0472","added a bilingual latest-update summary to the footer date interaction.":"t0473","在頁尾最後更新日期加入雙語的本次更新摘要。":"t0473","added rolling-digit animation to the total visitor count.":"t0474","讓總瀏覽人數套用與更新日期一致的數字翻動效果。":"t0474","added the footer last-updated date and shared visitor counter.":"t0475","在頁尾新增最後更新日期與總瀏覽人數統計。":"t0475","expanded the work archive with app / ui, 3d, drawing and editing projects.":"t0476","擴充 work archive，新增 app／ui、3d、繪畫與剪輯作品。":"t0476","spring yearn / visual work":"t0002","spring yearn / 視覺創作":"t0002","opening the work":"t0003","正在開啟作品集":"t0003","work index":"t0004","let’s take a look":"t0005","看看作品吧":"t0005","spring yearn / menu":"t0033","spring yearn / 網站導覽":"t0033","sy / experiments":"t0235","sy / 實驗":"t0235","sy / work index":"t0396","sy / 作品索引":"t0396","shared canvas / draw something":"t0329","共用畫布 / 一起塗鴉":"t0329","sy / shared canvas":"t0347","sy / 共用畫布":"t0347","need another board?":"t0358","還需要一張白板嗎？":"t0358","project files / free downloads":"t0288","專案檔 / 免費下載":"t0288","choose display language":"x0000","選擇顯示語言":"x0000","eraser size":"x0001","擦除範圍":"x0001","fit view":"x0002","email sent to springyearn. a new board is on the wish list.":"x0003","已寄信給 springyearn，請耐心等候新增白板。":"x0003","touch: use two fingers to zoom and move, one to draw. mouse: drag with the middle button; hold it and scroll the wheel to zoom.":"x0004","手機：雙指縮放與移動，單指繪畫。電腦：按住滑鼠中鍵拖曳；按住中鍵並滾動滾輪縮放。":"x0004","email requests are being set up. need a board sooner? use the contact page for now.":"x0005","寄信功能設定中。急著加白板的話，先從聯絡頁告訴我。":"x0005","共用白板 / 一起畫點什麼":"x0006","the board was cleared. refresh to keep drawing.":"x0007","白板已清空，重新整理後就能繼續畫。":"x0007","site updates":"x0008","網站更新":"x0008","cleared the shared whiteboard and added two-finger zoom/pan, middle-button controls, adjustable eraser size and simple operation instructions.":"v049-0","new-board requests now email springyearn through the server, with private credentials and duplicate protection; hourly codex checks are paused.":"v049-1","rewrote site copy in a friendlier voice and added japanese, korean, russian and vietnamese. language choices stay saved across pages; the desktop whiteboard shortcut now sits beside them.":"v049-2","清空共用白板，新增雙指縮放與移動、滑鼠中鍵操作、可調大小的橡皮擦及簡單操作說明。":"v049-0","新增白板申請改由伺服器直接寄信給 SpringYearn，憑證私密保存並避免重複通知；每小時的 Codex 檢查已暫停。":"v049-1","全站文案改得更親切，新增日語、韓語、俄語及越南語。語言選擇可跨頁保存，電腦版塗鴉板入口移至語言選單旁。":"v049-2","contact me":"t0186","聯繫我":"t0186","canvas view controls":"v050-ui-0","畫布檢視控制":"v050-ui-0","canvas zoom":"v050-ui-1","畫布縮放":"v050-ui-1","zoom out":"v050-ui-2","縮小畫布":"v050-ui-2","zoom in":"v050-ui-3","放大畫布":"v050-ui-3","drag":"v050-ui-4","拖曳":"v050-ui-4","zoom in, then use drag mode to move the canvas":"v050-ui-5","放大後，開啟拖曳模式移動畫布":"v050-ui-5","use the top-right slider or + / − buttons to zoom. turn on drag to move the canvas with the left mouse button or one finger; choose pen or eraser to keep drawing.":"v050-ui-6","使用右上角的滑桿或 ＋／－ 按鈕縮放。開啟「拖曳」後，用滑鼠左鍵或單指移動畫布；點選畫筆或橡皮擦即可繼續繪畫。":"v050-ui-6","changed the shared canvas to 1920 × 1080, with top-right zoom buttons, a slider and a drag toggle replacing touch gestures and middle-button controls.":"v050-note-0","matched the language dropdown and cursor to the site style. contact now places copy on the left and links on the right, with a shorter heading and the same body text.":"v050-note-1","共用畫布改為 1920 × 1080，右上角新增縮放滑桿、按鈕與拖曳模式，取代雙指手勢及滑鼠中鍵操作。":"v050-note-0","語言選單及游標統一為網站風格；contact 改為左側文案、右側連結，標題簡化為「聯繫我」，內文保留。":"v050-note-1"}